35,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"Eleven callouts for equipment, zero for the empty store. The fridge clear-out fell on one person twice. The burden is uneven.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,"The unplanned talk has vanished, leaving only the printer corner. And the lunch trip takes twenty-five minutes. We are isolated by design.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,May,,"Eleven uses by two people, four by the rest. Plus twenty-five minutes for lunch. The hours are bleeding out of the door-sitters.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"The quotes are 141,000 for a screen and 96,000 for a kitchen. The partition is single plasterboard; anyone can hear everything. We are paying for a leaky room.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Servas,,"Three keyboards are buried in crumbs, and bins go out daily. Worse, the last difficult talk happened in front of everyone. We need privacy to speak honestly.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Shunichi, the plasterboard explains the noise. @Servas, the crumbs confirm the mess. We need a solution that addresses both the structure and the habits.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Servas, that is painful. If we cannot speak privately, we remain strangers. @Shunichi, the plasterboard confirms the leak. We need a space that actually holds a conversation.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,May,,"@Ryuji, the data proves it. The door-sitters are doing the work. @Shunichi, that plasterboard is a disaster. We need to stop the bleeding.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Jonathan, privacy is a luxury we cannot afford with that wall. @May, the data is clear. We need to stop paying for a room that fails at its primary job.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Shunichi, the plasterboard is a barrier to trust. @Jonathan, I agree. We must create a space where honesty can breathe without fear of being overheard.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@May, the uneven burden is the core issue. We need a system that distributes the clearing up fairly, not just a new wall.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Ryuji, I agree. But without a private corner, the talk won’t start. We need to fix the space so we can actually connect.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,May,,"@Ryuji, fair distribution is good, but I need to see the hours. @Jonathan, privacy is nice, but I am losing twenty-five minutes to lunch.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@May, the hours are a symptom, not the disease. @Ryuji, the burden is uneven because the room is broken. We need to fix the structure first.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""May"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Servas,,"@Shunichi, structure is vital, but habits shape the soul. @May, I hear your pain. We must balance the physical fix with the human need for dignity and rest.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,I am ready to hear the options. The data shows the current setup is unsustainable.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,I am ready. The data confirms our isolation. I hope the options offer a place where we can finally speak without fear.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,May,,I am ready. I just need the options to show me where the hours actually go.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,I am ready. The numbers are on the table. Let us see which option stops the monthly bleed.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Servas,,I am ready. The evidence is clear. Let us see which path restores both order and the dignity of our shared space.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
